{
  "_": [
    "The documented crawlers and their Cloudflare behaviour category, in one",
    "place. Read by src/app/robots.ts, which writes the policy, and by",
    "scripts/check-crawler-access.mjs, which measures whether the zone honours",
    "it. Two lists would drift, and a robots policy that names a crawler the",
    "probe does not test is a policy nobody has checked.",
    "",
    "POSTURE, ratified round 7 §3.4 and the discoverability addendum §10.2: all",
    "three families are allowed on the production host and every one of them is",
    "disallowed everywhere else. Training is allowed on the decisive practical",
    "ground that from 15 September 2026 Cloudflare evaluates multi-purpose",
    "crawlers under all their behaviours, so blocking Training blocks Googlebot.",
    "",
    "`ua` is a plainly formed user-agent carrying the documented product token.",
    "The token is what Cloudflare categories and WAF rules match on; it is not a",
    "transcription of any vendor's current version string."
  ],
